          "name": "Policy_Retriever",
          "description": "Contains the Supplier Governance Policy for BQBYTE Technologies.\nUse this tool whenever questions involve:\n- Tier classification rules and thresholds\n- Volume Rebate eligibility criteria\n- SWL (Supplier Watch List) status and restrictions\n- OTD (On-Time Delivery) rate requirements\n- Defect rate limits and penalty escalation\n- Compliance score requirements\n- SLA thresholds and grace periods\n- Risk level definitions (Low / Medium / High)\n- Disruption response procedures (Level 1 / 2 / 3)\n- Concentration limits and diversification rules\n- Audit frequency and scoring methodology\n- Certification requirements by category and tier\n- Penalty percentages and corrective action rules\n\nThis tool provides policy rules and definitions only, not supplier data.\nAlways use this tool first before querying supplier data.",
